      "1": "Visible character fragments and repeated longer rows; many glyph identities remain ambiguous because strokes are missing or corrupted. No reliable whole-output transcription; some pages are dense ink fragments.",
      "2": "One blank page; other pages contain noisy bands or partly recognizable rows with unresolved glyph identities. Even short output 09091ee1db539502f1cc has ambiguous characters, so whole transcription is uncertain.",
