      "4": "No blank output visible. Dense noisy bands and repeated damaged character rows; the enlarged short row also contains ambiguous glyph shapes. Whole transcription uncertain for each page.",
      "5": "One blank page; two-glyph enlarged output has ambiguous incomplete forms. Remaining pages contain noise bands or long rows with missing strokes and unresolved character identities.",
      "6": "One blank page. Short numeric-like output includes unresolved surrounding glyphs; remaining noisy bands and repeated rows also cannot be transcribed wholly with confidence.",
      "7": "One blank page. Several pages share partly recognizable sequences, but missing strokes and corrupted glyphs prevent confident whole-output transcription. Other pages are dense noise bands.",
