      "9": "No blank page; both enlarged short rows contain unresolved glyph identities, and longer rows have missing strokes or dense noise. Whole transcription is uncertain on each page.",
      "10": "One blank page. Repeated long character sequences have recognizable pieces but unresolved glyphs throughout; other outputs are dense fragmented rows. No reliable full transcription.",
      "11": "All pages nonblank. Enlarged short outputs have clear fragments and digits but ambiguous other glyphs; long strings have unresolved characters. No confident whole-output transcription.",
      "12": "All pages nonblank. Some rows are partly legible while others dissolve into dense fragmented strokes; every output retains unresolved glyph identities preventing a complete transcription.",
      "13": "One blank page. Nonblank pages contain noisy bands or repeated Chinese/numeric rows with omitted or corrupted strokes; all whole-output transcriptions remain uncertain.",
      "14": "No blank page. Even the enlarged punctuation-separated short string has ambiguous glyph identities. Longer rows contain missing strokes and noise; no confident full transcription.",
      "15": "Two blank pages; others show damaged repeated sequences, digits mixed with incomplete glyphs or fragmented noise rows. Whole transcription remains uncertain for all nonblank outputs.",
      "16": "Two blank pages. Short enlarged outputs still contain unresolved glyphs despite readable fragments; longer rows and noisy bands likewise prevent a confident full transcription.",
      "17": "One blank page. Partly recognizable repeated rows, mixed digits and dense noise bands all contain unresolved glyph identities, preventing whole-output transcription.",
      "18": "Three blank pages. Short enlarged strings, including two-glyph output, contain ambiguous damaged forms; long nonblank rows have unresolved glyphs or dense noise. Full transcriptions uncertain.",
      "19": "One blank page. The remaining pages contain partly recognizable but damaged character rows or dense noise; unresolved glyph identities prevent full transcription.",
      "20": "One blank page. Other outputs include repeated partly legible rows and fragmented noise bands; multiple character identities remain ambiguous on every nonblank page.",
      "21": "No blank output. Enlarged short row contains ambiguous damaged glyphs; long numeric/character strings and noisy bands also cannot be transcribed completely with confidence.",
      "22": "No blank output. Every page has unresolved character identities, either from incomplete glyph strokes in partly recognizable rows or dense ink fragmentation. Whole transcription uncertain.",
      "23": "One blank page. The short single-row output and longer strings all include unresolved character forms; dense bands likewise cannot be wholly transcribed.",
